cmu-health-analyzer-advice-seizure = [color=#B05BD5][font="Emoji"]🧠[/font][/color] У пациента судорожный приступ. Введите одну дозу фенитоина.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-asthma-attack = [color=#5887D5][font="Emoji"]🫁[/font][/color] У пациента приступ астмы. Введите одну дозу альбутерола.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-panic-attack = [color=#FFAA00][font="Emoji"]😰[/font][/color] У пациента паническая атака. Отведите его в безопасное место, чтобы он успокоился.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-heart-episode = [color=#FF5050][font="Emoji"]🫀[/font][/color] У пациента сердечный приступ. Введите одну дозу кардиокаина или эпинефрина.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-internals = [color=#5887D5][font="Emoji"]🫁[/font][/color] Patient can't breathe. Connect them to an oxygen tank (internals) with a mask.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-stump = [color=red][font="Emoji"]🩸[/font][/color] Clamp the bleeding stump with a tourniquet.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-arterial-bleed = [color=red][font="Emoji"]🩸[/font][/color] Arterial bleeding. Apply a tourniquet or hemostatic gauze.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-external-bleed = [color=red][font="Emoji"]🩹[/font][/color] Stop the bleeding with gauze or a trauma dressing.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-internal-bleed = [color=#A02020][font="Emoji"]🩸[/font][/color] Internal bleeding. Patient needs surgery to repair it.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-overdose = [color=#B64646][font="Emoji"]💉[/font][/color] Overdosing on { $reagent }. Hold off on more and use naloxone or dialysis if it's severe.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-painkillers = [color=#FFAA00][font="Emoji"]💊[/font][/color] Administer painkillers, like tramadol, to prevent pain shock.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-hypothermia = [color=#7FC8FF][font="Emoji"]🌡[/font][/color] Patient is hypothermic. Get them warm.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-hyperthermia = [color=#FF8040][font="Emoji"]🌡[/font][/color] Patient is overheating. Cool them down.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-splint = [color=#5B88B0][font="Emoji"]🦴[/font][/color] Splint the fractured limbs.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-shrapnel = [color=#9A9A9A][font="Emoji"]🔩[/font][/color] Remove the embedded shrapnel.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-allergy = [color=#FF5050][font="Emoji"]⚠[/font][/color] Allergic reaction to { $reagent }! Give epinephrine.

cmu-health-analyzer-advice-allergy-unknown = [color=#FF5050][font="Emoji"]⚠[/font][/color] Allergic reaction! Give epinephrine.
